# Content Creation Studio - Future Roadmap 🚀

## 📊 What We've Accomplished

### ✅ **Completed Features:**

1. **Dashboard Revamp** - Real-time analytics with charts
2. **WebSocket Notifications** - Real-time updates (replaced Firebase)
3. **Content Page Redesign** - Tabbed filters (Content/Research)
4. **API Priority Management** - Drag-and-drop provider ordering
5. **BYOK Pricing** - Bring Your Own Key pricing model
6. **Landing Page** - Complete redesign with all features
7. **Settings Integration** - Brand Voice, API Keys, Billing
8. **Code Cleanup** - Removed 167 lines of unwanted code
9. **API Client Fixes** - Fixed 26 endpoint issues
10. **Content Consistency** - 100% UI text synchronization
11. **Coming Soon Labels** - Professional feature placeholders

